cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "citytwin: an auditable geospatial digital twin toolkit"
abstract: "Builds a LoD1 city model from OpenStreetMap footprints, completes missing building heights with a calibrated rule and conformal intervals, propagates that uncertainty into an urban heat-exposure index, and publishes the result as CityJSON 1.1, 3D Tiles 1.1 and an OGC API Features service, with a read-only tool-using agent and PROV-JSON provenance."
version: 0.5.0
date-released: 2026-11-11
license: MIT
type: software
authors:
